---
description: 
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---
when writing:
1. trace, debug, info, warn, error log messages.
2. errors.
3. comments.
4. function docs.
5. module docs.
write them all lowercase.
things to never write lowercase:
* special keywords in Dockerfile e.g. FROM, ENV, RUN
* cli flags e.g. curl -S is not the same as -s